---
layout: base.njk
navyHeader: true
title: Admizz Group — Transforming Education & Careers Globally
description: Admizz Group is a global education and workforce development company — connecting students and professionals with the preparation, guidance and pathways to reach their next opportunity.
permalink: /
---

{# ============================================================ HERO
   Entrance is choreographed by GSAP (main.js, [data-hero-in]) when motion is
   allowed; every element here renders fully visible in plain HTML/CSS first,
   so a no-JS visitor or reduced-motion user sees the complete page either way. #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep min-h-[92vh] flex flex-col justify-center">
  {% include "partials/facet-field.njk" %}
  {# WebGL enhancement layer — see hero-field.js. Empty div until JS (if
     motion is allowed) mounts a canvas into it; the SVG above is the
     complete, correct background either way. #}
  <div class="hero-field absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="shell relative py-32 md:py-0 w-full">
    <span class="eyebrow-on-navy inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-hero-in>
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-navy-accent inline-block shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Est. 2015 &middot; Denver, Colorado
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 font-display font-light text-display-1 text-navy-on max-w-[18ch]">
      <span class="block" data-hero-in>Transforming education</span>
      <span class="block" data-hero-in>and careers, <em class="italic text-navy-accent font-book">globally.</em></span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-8 text-body-lg text-navy-on-muted max-w-measure-tight" data-hero-in>
      {{ site.description }}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4" data-hero-in>
      <a href="#ventures" class="btn-primary">
        Explore our ventures
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost-on-navy">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative border-t border-white/10 py-5">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-on-muted/70 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1" data-hero-in>
        {% for v in ventures %}<span><span class="text-navy-accent/70 tabular-nums">{{ v.index }}</span> {{ v.name }}{% if not loop.last %} &middot;{% endif %}</span>{% endfor %}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ THE ECOSYSTEM (register)
   The former standalone "Statement" section (its own eyebrow+headline+paragraph
   module) was cut here, not relocated — on inspection its copy was a near-verbatim
   restatement of the hero subhead above, with the "three pillars" line it added
   already covered more concretely by the venture-name ticker (real names, not
   category words) and by this register, which explains all three ventures in full. #}
<section id="ventures" class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-4 fade-up">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">One Ecosystem</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h2 text-ink">Many ways forward.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-body text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight md:text-right">
        Three ventures, three stages of the same journey — from readiness, to admission, to career.
      </p>
    </div>

    {% include "partials/ventures-register.njk" %}

    <a href="/ventures/" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">
      View all ventures in detail
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ STATEMENT BAND #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy py-section-sm">
  <div class="shell relative">
    <p class="font-display font-light text-display-2 text-navy-on max-w-[18ch] leading-tight text-balance fade-up">
      From vision to reality, <em class="italic text-navy-accent font-book">shaping futures</em> through innovation, collaboration, and a commitment to quality education.
    </p>
    <span class="mt-8 block font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-on-muted fade-up" style="animation-delay:100ms">&mdash; Admizz Group</span>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ THE RECORD (timeline)
   A static connecting rule, not an interaction — the site keeps exactly one bespoke
   interactive device (the ventures register's gold line, above). This is plain CSS. #}
<section class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="mb-10 fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h2 text-ink">Building since 2015.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-measure">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-[1.6rem] inset-y-2 w-px bg-rule-strong" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      {% for t in timeline %}
      <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[3.25rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-1 py-6 border-t border-rule first:border-t-0 fade-up" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}ms">
        <span class="font-mono text-small text-navy-soft font-medium tabular-nums relative z-10 bg-paper md:pr-2">{{ t.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-h4 font-display font-book text-ink">{{ t.label }}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-small text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">{{ t.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <a href="/about/" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">
      Read our full story
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ AT A GLANCE
   Replaces a Founder block that was duplicated verbatim from /about/ — that
   content's correct single home is the "Our Story" page. This slot uses only
   facts already verified in site.json/ventures.json, as data rows rather than
   a repeated prose block. Rows stagger in via GSAP (main.js, [data-glance-row])
   when motion is allowed; every row is plain visible text otherwise. #}
<section class="bg-paper-sunk py-section-sm">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="eyebrow fade-up">At a Glance</span>
    <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-16" data-glance>
      <div>
        <div class="data-row" data-glance-row>
          <span class="data-label">Founded</span>
          <span class="text-body font-medium text-ink font-mono tabular-nums">{{ site.founded }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-row" data-glance-row>
          <span class="data-label">Headquarters</span>
          <span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">{{ site.address }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="data-row" data-glance-row>
          <span class="data-label">Ventures</span>
          <span class="text-body font-medium text-ink font-mono tabular-nums">{{ ventures | length }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="data-row" data-glance-row>
          <span class="data-label">The Path</span>
          <span class="text-body font-medium text-ink">{% for v in ventures %}{{ v.stage }}{% if not loop.last %} &middot; {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ INSIGHTS #}
<section class="bg-paper py-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-12 fade-up">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h2 text-ink">Ideas for what's next.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/insights/" class="text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline shrink-0">View all insights</a>
    </div>

    {% for lead in insights %}{% if lead.featured %}
    <article class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center pb-10 border-b border-rule fade-up">
      <a href="/insights/{{ lead.slug }}/" class="block rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep">
        {% image "src/assets/images/insights/" + lead.image, lead.imageAlt, "(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" %}
      </a>
      <div>
        <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-soft">{{ lead.venture }}</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display font-book text-h3 text-ink">
          <a href="/insights/{{ lead.slug }}/" class="hover:text-navy-soft transition-colors duration-press ease-signature">{{ lead.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-muted max-w-measure">{{ lead.deck }}</p>
        <a href="/insights/{{ lead.slug }}/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">Read the piece</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}

    <div class="mt-2">
      {% for post in insights %}
      {% if not post.featured %}
      <article class="register-row fade-up" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}ms">
        <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="block rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-square">
          {% image "src/assets/images/insights/" + post.image, post.imageAlt, "9rem" %}
        </a>
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-soft">{{ post.venture }}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-display font-book text-ink">
            <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="hover:text-navy-soft transition-colors duration-press ease-signature">{{ post.title }}</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-small text-ink-muted max-w-measure">{{ post.deck }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================ CLOSE #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-deep py-section">
  {% include "partials/facet-field.njk" %}
  <div class="shell relative text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    <span class="eyebrow-on-navy fade-up">Get in touch</span>
    <h2 class="mt-4 font-display font-light text-display-2 text-navy-on max-w-[16ch] text-balance fade-up" style="animation-delay:80ms">
      Let's talk about <em class="italic text-navy-accent font-book">what's next.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 fade-up" style="animation-delay:160ms">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="btn-ghost-on-navy">{{ site.email }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
